<title>POLAND: NFI units close up in continuous trade.</title>
<headline>NFI units close up in continuous trade.</headline>
<dateline>WARSAW 1996-09-05</dateline>
<text>
<p>Polish NFI units rose 3.4 percent to 105 zlotys in 2.1-million zloty continuous trade on Friday. Thursday turnover was at four million zlotys.</p>
<p>No stocks in the continuous system traded on Friday.</p>
<p>-- Warsaw Newsroom +48 22 653 9700</p>
</text>
